     "summary": "Pin reports a gone sub-feature, a mapped sentence gone or outside it, an unmapped requirement, and prose that differs from the source's pin.",
     "rationale": "Independent checks found false greens: a moved sentence (F1), a new requirement (F2), and a rule written inside a Run sentence (X1). Each now flags the claim. A review reason is product drift, so only an unreadable file is an error. Verified by the featuremap tests and the claims.md drive (cl-moved, cl-unmapped, cl-prose).",
     "author": "fm/verilex-claim-model"
    },
